@startuml

' Define classes with colors
class Object

' Reader hierarchy (blue)
class Reader #lightblue
class InputStreamReader #lightblue
class FileReader #lightblue
class BufferedReader #lightblue

' Writer hierarchy (green)
class Writer #lightgreen
class OutputStreamWriter #lightgreen
class FileWriter #lightgreen
class BufferedWriter #lightgreen
class PrintWriter #lightgreen

' Inheritance relationships
Object <|-- Reader
Object <|-- Writer

Reader <|-- InputStreamReader
InputStreamReader <|-- FileReader
Reader <|-- BufferedReader

Writer <|-- OutputStreamWriter
OutputStreamWriter <|-- FileWriter
Writer <|-- BufferedWriter
Writer <|-- PrintWriter

' Optional: Add note for context
note right of Object
  Java I/O Class Hierarchy
  Character-based streams
end note

note right of FileWriter
    low level writer
    ,writes characters to file
end note

note right of FileReader
    low level reader,
    ,read characters from file
end note
@enduml